{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/846319-steal-the-solid-reflection-and-other-splats","id":846319,"title":"Steal The Solid Reflection and other splats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-12T16:14:08-08:00","id":846319,"title":"Steal The Solid Reflection and other splats","content":"So this Contract with the Seeming effects seems perfect for messing with other splat. You can pull a Mage's working artifact from its reflection, or pull a vampire out and have it embrace abunch of people, or pull out a demon that makes soul pacts that you never have to worry about it cashing in on as when the contracts time is up it goes back to being a reflection, or a Begotten's Kraken soul, pulled from its reflection in the waters of its lair.<br /> <br /> A powerful Wyrd 10 Changeling might even do that to the refection of an Archmage.<br /> <br /> A Changeling with this contract could provide an endless supply of food for a vampire by pulling people out of reflections for vampire to eat.<br /> <br /> Oddly it could also pull Hobgoblins, Fetches, and Huntsmen out.<br /> <br /> I don't think this would work in dreams as its just a dream of a reflection and it has no access to the &quot;world&quot; of reflections where ever that is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T16:25:31-08:00","id":846322,"title":"","content":"I don't see where in the text of my copy it says that a stolen reflection <i>obeys your command,</i> though. Still pretty great for being able to do things like temporarily team up with yourself (if you don't think too closely about the ethics of creating an intelligent being doomed to dissipate after only a half-hour of existence, at least).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T16:55:35-08:00","id":846332,"title":"","content":"The Strangest thing to pull from a reflection would be a Sin Eater (I'm assuming sin eater and geist are a package deal), a Supernatural Entity (its Supernatural Symbols would be inverted), an Abyssal Entity (its symbols would be inverted or reverted?), or oddest of all a Mummy who you could use to raise the dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T17:36:06-08:00","id":846346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/846319-steal-the-solid-reflection-and-other-splats?p=846322#post846322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see where in the text of my copy it says that a stolen reflection <i>obeys your command,</i> though. Still pretty great for being able to do things like temporarily team up with yourself (if you don't think too closely about the ethics of creating an intelligent being doomed to dissipate after only a half-hour of existence, at least).</div> </div> </div> </div> Good point, you'd want the cooperation of any powerful beings whose reflections you pull from their reflecting surface.<br /> <br /> But its easy to provide insentives.<br /> <br /> Example pulling the reflection of a Mage with 5 Death Arcana so that the reflection can cast Atonement on a dying loved one of the Mage, raising them from the dead and awakening them.<br /> <br /> You could pull a normal person from a reflection and then talk that person into making a soul pact with a demon, then get the demon to take the cover.<br /> <br /> As understand it, the demon would be burned by it, because its a magic creature of sorts, but the cover would be end up totally human and it wouldn't revert when the contract ends.<br /> <br /> But the original person would still exist intact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T17:38:28-08:00","id":846348,"title":"","content":"Using it ay lower wyrd has one advantage, the living reflection would have lower resistance traits which means it would be easier to control, possible mentally disabled and nearly insane (intergity of 1), but much easier to control.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-12T21:21:16-08:00","id":846431,"title":"","content":"Huntsmen coming, steal own reflection, give to huntsmen, get token, use token on other you, get drinks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1377-wrequis","name":"Wrequis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-13T17:24:17-07:00","id":846816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wrequis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/846319-steal-the-solid-reflection-and-other-splats?p=846431#post846431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huntsmen coming, steal own reflection, give to huntsmen, get token, use token on other you, get drinks.</div> </div> </div> </div> Its like your reading my mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":""