ouse as give them a fake home to go back to, only to reveal and revel in the fakeness of it. Imagine what a huntsman would do. It may not even try to take you back alive next time...and it may get help from other huntsmen, whom its token doesn't give help against. And even if your reflection survived the trip to Arcadia...well, let's just say your Gentry's <i>very</i> unlikely to fall for the illusion for long, and very likely to punish the huntsman so foolish as to bring back the wrong &quot;you&quot;.<br /> <br /> Simply put, I think it's a bad idea. :-p","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5803,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","user":"Taidragon","date":". 03-14-2016, 06:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-14T15:49:23-07:00","id":847353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Errol216</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/846319-steal-the-solid-reflection-and-other-splats?p=847145#post847145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Two Glamour.<br /> <br /> One army.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I like the way you think. That being said- <i>pretty </i>sure that breaks the Contract. Of course, if you've done the setup to trap your opponent in a room of mirrors to do 